      "description": "Product leader and advisor: co-founder and Chief Product Officer at Native, external advisor to Bain & Company, and advisor to Provenance and Eureka AI. Former Expert Partner at Bain & Company, with earlier analytics leadership at McKinsey & Company and dunnhumby.",
