    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#faq-career-native-origin",
      "name": "What connects his retail AI experience to joining Native?",
      "url": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile#faq-career-native-origin",
      "about": {
        "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#person"
      },
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Brock connects his decision to join Native with enterprise-data problems he encountered while working on retail AI."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#faq-career-first-dunnhumby-job",
      "name": "What drew Brock to dunnhumby?",
      "url": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile#faq-career-first-dunnhumby-job",
      "about": {
        "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#person"
      },
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Brock says an interest in understanding real people through transaction and loyalty data drew him to dunnhumby."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#faq-career-mckinsey-asia-emphasis",
      "name": "How did his McKinsey work in Asia differ in emphasis?",
      "url": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile#faq-career-mckinsey-asia-emphasis",
      "about": {
        "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#person"
      },
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Brock describes more of his McKinsey work in Asia as focused on data monetization and coalition loyalty, reflecting the conglomerates he worked with in the region."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#faq-still-at-bain",
      "name": "Is Brock Simon still at Bain & Company?",
      "url": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile#faq-still-at-bain",
      "about": {
        "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#person"
      },
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "No. He was Expert Associate Partner at Bain & Company from June 2019 and Expert Partner from July 2022 to November 2025, in San Francisco. Since January 2026 he has been an external advisor to Bain & Company, providing advisory support on select projects, including retail AI work, alongside his role as co-founder and Chief Product Officer of Native."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#faq-what-is-native",
      "name": "What is Native, and what is his role there?",
      "url": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile#faq-what-is-native",
      "about": {
        "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#person"
      },
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Native describes its work as database reasoning for complex enterprise data: it helps enterprises understand complex data by reasoning across the data itself, discovering structure, relationships, definitions, exceptions and gaps so teams can build reliable data foundations. Brock Simon is its co-founder and Chief Product Officer since January 2026 and based in the San Francisco Bay Area. Native's company page gives 2025 as its founding year and lists him among its people."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#faq-mckinsey-title",
      "name": "What was his title at McKinsey & Company?",
      "url": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile#faq-mckinsey-title",
      "about": {
        "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#person"
      },
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Expert Associate Partner, in Chicago from August 2015 to August 2017 and in Bangkok from August 2017 to May 2019, as he records it on LinkedIn. Illinois Tech's Marketing Analytics Advisory Council page recorded the title as Expert associate principal, with a focus on marketing and digital analytics in retail and consumer packaged goods."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#faq-where-did-he-study",
      "name": "Where did he study?",
      "url": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile#faq-where-did-he-study",
      "about": {
        "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#person"
      },
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Miami University: BS in Mathematics and Statistics and MS in Mathematics. Xavier University: MBA. The corrected wording agrees with Illinois Tech and the owner-approved résumé evidence. The earlier BA wording was an error; Bain’s historical biography uses MSc in mathematics and statistics. No diploma or degree dates have been verified."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#faq-same-person-dunnhumby",
      "name": "Is this the same Brock Simon who worked for dunnhumby in Turkey and Shanghai?",
      "url": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile#faq-same-person-dunnhumby",
      "about": {
        "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#person"
      },
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. His decade at dunnhumby, from 2005 to 2015, ran from Cincinnati through Atlanta, Bangkok, Portland and Izmir to Shanghai, ending as Head of Solutions for Asia. Bain's team page and his LinkedIn both record it. This record is not about other people who share the name."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#faq-what-has-he-written",
      "name": "What has he written or spoken about?",
      "url": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile#faq-what-has-he-written",
      "about": {
        "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#person"
      },
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Three Bain & Company articles in 2025, each co-authored: on data monetisation with AI (first-named of five authors, June 2025), Google Cloud Next (first-named of four, April 2025) and Nvidia GTC (second-named of seven, March 2025); a servicePath Executive Conversations podcast on agentic AI, personalisation, loyalty and data monetisation; a Provenance webinar on AI shopping and verified product data; and the MAUSTRAP Podcast on why he founded Native and how AI changes product decisions. profile.json lists each with its link and its byline."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#faq-mcp-server",
      "name": "Does Brock Simon have an MCP server?",
      "url": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile#faq-mcp-server",
      "about": {
        "@id": "https://brockdsimon.com/profile.jsonld#person"
      },
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. The record is also served as a read-only MCP server at https://brockdsimon.com/record/mcp (Streamable HTTP, POST, no credentials). Its tools return the record's answers to questions about his experience, each item with its citation URL and evidence label, and the record's files are its resources. Its server card is at https://brockdsimon.com/record/mcp/server-card. It answers only from this record."
      }
    },
